              <l xml:id="m-58999cea-be8e-4e8a-88a0-2e0ab9c54ab0" facs="#m-b6e4b76c-ed2e-4df2-be24-6d13aa583286" label="ambiguous">1328</l><l xml:id="m-d338c444-7be1-4634-87c0-03737e35b730" facs="#m-17c27de1-7174-470c-ba08-0a5184139762" label="ambiguous">Ianuary 14.</l><l xml:id="m-13530172-25e3-49cd-8290-8206b9895b01" facs="#m-3c1003e8-a1b2-4abb-bfef-eb5e7b50dd1e" label="lyrics-like">rum: et in fi- nes ór- bis tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c0c1286-ba63-4aa1-8eaa-48dbb51a2aad" facs="#m-2f534557-e251-46a1-9a3a-5fbb082ded63" label="lyrics-like">só- nus e-6-</l><l xml:id="m-720ccbd0-7e9a-44ce-b1ed-b5109d6bfc7e" facs="#m-732fbf4c-7579-4261-9c6e-81e62fd3e6e2" label="lyrics-like">e-órum.</l><l xml:id="m-f2adc434-91e7-45c5-ab9b-7f9b7b6d1a51" facs="#m-5b47c101-2f67-42cf-9b50-33fcfc4ff79c" label="lyrics-like">rae vérba</l><l xml:id="m-a88489cb-3eea-41e7-b251-a32b3a3ba158" facs="#m-e92d3a04-17af-4b9c-bc1f-ebb603c7ff67" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-4a3402ae-002c-4117-815a-1fa1b2839d5b" facs="#m-2427c144-788b-496c-8202-b8f586b273e2" label="lyrics-like">Ebitum tibi, Dómine, nostrae tueáris, cuius honoránda confes¬</l><l xml:id="m-2cb00a1d-f069-4cf2-b1cb-9b62d9f2141d" facs="#m-3ac41780-da5d-49b5-8868-5bfad8adf847" label="lyrics-like">U réddimus servitútis, suppliciter sióne laudis tibi hóstias immolámus.</l><l xml:id="m-9f76bd39-0f5e-43ce-b348-220fd8a45cce" facs="#m-04f53fd4-6cb2-41e1-bceb-98ad6f9e3ec5" label="lyrics-like">exorántes: ut suffrágiis beãti Tho¬Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4191bd1d-e038-44e2-aebb-7efb0b98302b" facs="#m-dfaa3bd7-a3b8-4035-be8f-19ed172e99a7" label="lyrics-like">mae Apóstoli, in nobis tua múnera</l><l xml:id="m-65258e10-ebe6-4813-9ad8-f7bc7f1f696f" facs="#m-4de364bd-dea0-4130-b917-37af4f85a5ec" label="text-like">Preface of the Apostles, p. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-f51c83e9-86f6-430e-9560-37c85eddeb25" facs="#m-6646a7b6-d051-4b09-bc58-b9638dfc2235" label="ambiguous">comm.8</l><l xml:id="m-e032ae9c-6c21-456e-af0b-31044bdc6a6f" facs="#m-7297d0d7-e476-4b1b-aa40-f66043d15a04" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-cb6fcba8-1a01-4819-81d1-bd7888bc1dab" facs="#m-71972973-2b3a-4f1a-aba6-be55159af6e5" label="lyrics-like">AL It-te"“ mánum tú-am, et cognósce lóca cla-vó¬</l><l xml:id="m-810b82ef-0ac4-400b-a138-c32ef3f7b529" facs="#m-653bb7a0-6317-44de-8344-873bdef50f82" label="lyrics-like">rum: et nó-li ésse incrédu-lus sed fidé¬ lis.</l><l xml:id="m-588044db-b3e5-4152-a0d9-00372e0911f3" facs="#m-5a48165a-440e-4f55-bffa-7993ca16240f" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-5ef52276-315a-466d-a9d4-d95667ebe2ac" facs="#m-d0ac7530-bbe3-4d9c-a22f-160cfc511a02" label="lyrics-like">H Désto nobis, miséricors Deus: propitiátus dona custódi. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec8db951-fb7f-4a5f-8550-0e9db37f31a1" facs="#m-b3b6a93a-b6f7-4611-a0d2-6067e0714802" label="lyrics-like">Il et intercedénte pro nobis beãto minum.</l><l xml:id="m-8af95cda-8f3c-4140-9b79-7b7e315ca957" facs="#m-8e80f7b9-cce8-44ea-b9c7-19dbe95186ce" label="lyrics-like">Thoma Apóstolo; tua circa nos</l><l xml:id="m-89ed5411-4178-426c-af82-62642a813868" facs="#m-a509a362-6d34-4733-b555-0686fc1ecbc4" label="ambiguous">===----- ---  --- ------ -----a</l><l xml:id="m-83734d39-187b-4262-b6e3-45d8e529aae2" facs="#m-7cc8ad10-eca4-4200-b132-9085ac9bac18" label="text-like">FEASTS OF JANUARY.</l><l xml:id="m-c6fe5f2b-21a1-46b8-9d4c-a3ec675e29ac" facs="#m-674f2fb2-d20c-4ab1-b660-21b315019f66" label="ambiguous">14.</l><l xml:id="m-8390bea6-963b-4027-8069-07425d48d3ba" facs="#m-9bfbbf51-940f-4089-b64e-09d3c9f00f3c" label="ambiguous">St. Hilary,</l><l xml:id="m-6b86ac09-c4a0-437c-b3d0-a40d3a2c0095" facs="#m-c319272d-9ff8-4599-84cb-4a4432cb2e8d" label="text-like">Bishop, Confessor and Doctor of the Church. Double.</l><l xml:id="m-8e4ef5e3-ed84-4b30-8c79-0b25061094a1" facs="#m-15b5c465-bd78-4af7-b55b-68d670b776d9" label="lyrics-like">At ist and 2nd Vespers, at Magn. Ant. O Dóctor... beáte Hilári. p. 262s.</l><l xml:id="m-5189216b-0b0c-4410-9de8-5ad246de49ee" facs="#m-cebab757-2bbd-48be-83c8-57e109980ef6" label="lyrics-like">Mass. In médio. 1190.</l><l xml:id="m-502eb9e0-0564-473e-83c6-5ca23cd35082" facs="#m-9e5d2b39-e300-4859-9931-d6821a946021" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-5d5984b1-8205-423c-80d7-547899978e78" facs="#m-9cc81545-572e-49e1-9736-4c5e4b4bce9e" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui pópulo tuo aetérnae habúimus in terris, * intercessórem</l><l xml:id="m-364e2540-b13c-4b7b-befd-e708b1263497" facs="#m-9f479c40-5577-4c4f-a9ab-03f9d8be3f8e" label="lyrics-like">I salútis beãtum Hilárium miní¬</l><l xml:id="m-3a528fca-8f4e-4dcf-8516-a0764f2ea205" facs="#m-c5dd5320-4d4b-4e4a-81aa-9f39c73e8597" label="lyrics-like">habére mereámur in caelis. Per</l><l xml:id="m-d346e6ec-9bbe-42fd-bc22-3f171c75a242" facs="#m-b7c9ba4d-5977-4b31-b661-19342907fd73" label="lyrics-like">strum tribuisti: t praesta quaésu¬</l><l xml:id="m-292e36fa-7e60-4e6b-9d74-489bb1cf07e4" facs="#m-2129b899-04d3-4f26-af2e-c4cba7983f5a" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-867ff514-d66c-43c7-a094-392949dc488d" facs="#m-7f72cbe4-d74e-43cf-aa26-b5850ed35a3d" label="lyrics-like">mus; ut quem Doctórem vitae</l><l xml:id="m-b051bbc4-2d64-4125-99b6-3ac57868478a" facs="#m-983980d4-6970-4919-923c-85ae6def5936" label="text-like">Commemoration of St. Felix. Priest and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-4978ed19-fa6a-44cd-9831-9c856a5e452d" facs="#m-9e0d4a72-22e5-423b-9438-f5d6697b7ae8" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-48921d59-062e-4451-849c-7409ebad3813" facs="#m-2c48d0ea-9196-4f81-ab2e-ee038aca5323" label="lyrics-like">VOncéde, quaésumus, omnípotens ! próvocent; * quátenus quorum so¬</l><l xml:id="m-85744e68-2da4-429a-865c-549a9da8b83a" facs="#m-3b7880d7-a06d-47f8-bf4b-cad70f5b4986" label="lyrics-like">LDeus: t ut ad meliórem vitam</l><l xml:id="m-8a3926b1-af30-4431-9118-27fdc2055144" facs="#m-3e7c9edd-0f4b-49e3-bc82-43973b54f3b0" label="lyrics-like">lémnia ágimus, étiam actus imité¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ce910f6-e1e3-47f6-9242-f08c6d4602a7" facs="#m-73ccc280-62b2-4394-8067-d990937ffab4" label="lyrics-like">sanctórum tuórum exémpla nosl mur. Per Dóminum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
